WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.867
LOOK. Show a clean stream before contamination.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.509
ADD. Show waste and runoff moving toward water, clearly labelled unsafe.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:12.716
TRACE. Use arrows to show how floodwater can carry dirt.

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:16.883
PROTECT. Show covered bins and safe treated drinking water.
